   "source": "Hand-assembled from the recordings beside it: one case per hianime listing, its show key and card title copied from tests/fixtures/hianime/picker/ (the audited pairings in backend/src/commands/play_native_walk_fixture_test.rs, other cards of the recorded pools) or from a reported Continue card; `right` is the Kitsu entry the listing is, read off the recorded hits; `picks` is what the guess takes at each episode, `ruled_out` the recorded hits the row rules out at each episode, and `enrichment` what the resolve from the show key's words answers for a row whose guess reaches it, all pinned by the corpus tests.",
